                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3845f683-a7a7-3961-b439-c10017f3e82a",
                        "entry_id": "3d1ebfb1-7315-3ef4-957c-fcc931658643",
                        "glosses": [
                            "voluptuary"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "23351493-ac13-4136-8d5f-9b15805d4af7",
                                "sense_id": "3845f683-a7a7-3961-b439-c10017f3e82a",
                                "text": "Тут, кста́ти, ну́жно обозна́чить оди́н твёрдый факт: он вполне́ был уве́рен, что Фёдор Па́влович непреме́нно предло́жит (е́сли уж не предложи́л) Гру́шеньке зако́нный брак, и не ве́рил ни мину́ты, что ста́рый сластолю́бец наде́ется отде́латься лишь тремя́ ты́сячами.",
                                "translation": "Here, we must note, by the way, one certain fact: he was firmly persuaded that Fyodor Pavlovitch would offer, or perhaps had offered, Grushenka lawful wedlock, and did not for a moment believe that the old voluptuary hoped to gain his object for three thousand roubles.",
                                "english": "Here, we must note, by the way, one certain fact: he was firmly persuaded that Fyodor Pavlovitch would offer, or perhaps had offered, Grushenka lawful wedlock, and did not for a moment believe that the old voluptuary hoped to gain his object for three thousand roubles."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
